   "lineRange": [
    54,
    414
   ],
   "summary": "preset 注册表服务（Service Definition + Provider，继承 TypertRemoteService 暴露 @Remote 面）：register 即时激活并保留失败可见；revision=scope+mount 的 Generation 按用户数回收；mount/composeFrom 把 Agent scope 经 bindScopeParent 挂到共享 mount；select 在会话首回合前经 turn 边界校验换 preset 并落 agent-preset/selected 事件。",
   "tags": [
    "service-definition",
    "provider",
    "revision-gc",
    "typert-remote",
    "scope-binding"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
