   "name": "mount.ts",
   "filePath": "packages/preset/agent-preset-registry/src/mount.ts",
   "summary": "preset 的运行时插件树：PresetTree 继承 EntryTree 但 no-op commit（仅内存，不持久化）；mountPreset 在 scope 内装树并审计——失败行与根 realm 服务泄漏即拒载，等待 Host 服务的行保持挂载待其自愈；leakedServices/serviceForMount 按 fiber 对象同一性判定所有权。",
   "tags": [
    "mount",
    "entry-tree",
    "audit",
    "fiber-identity"
   ],
